#: playfield.cpp:254
msgid ""
"Your opponent is using a pre-KDE4 version of KBattleship. Note that, "
"according to the rules enforced by old clients, ships cannot be placed "
"adjacent to one another."
msgstr ""
"Dien Gegensmann bruukt en öller Verschoon vun KBattleship as för KDE-4. "
"Beacht, Scheep mööt wegen de öller Regeln nich blang bi blang liggen."

#: playfield.cpp:267
msgid "Enemy has shot. Shoot now!"
msgstr "De Gegensmann hett schaten. Scheet nu."

#: playfield.cpp:271
msgid "Waiting for enemy to shoot..."
msgstr "An't Töven op Schööt vun den Gegensmann..."

#: playfield.cpp:280
msgid "Ships placed. Now shoot on the enemy field!"
msgstr "Scheep opstellt. Scheet nu op Dien Gegensmann sien Feld!"

#: playfield.cpp:283
msgid "Waiting for other player to start the game..."
msgstr "An't Töven, dat de Gegensmann dat Speel start..."

#: playfield.cpp:287
msgid "Waiting for other player to place his ships..."
msgstr "An't Töven, dat de Gegensmann sien Scheep opstellt..."

#: playfield.cpp:296
msgid "Place your ships. Use the right mouse button to rotate them."
msgstr "Stell Dien Scheep op. Mit de rechte Muustast laat se sik dreihen."

